<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Question:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> In Canadian direct banking, what is notable about the way Alterna Bank allows its customers to access their accounts compared to most other direct banks?</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Answer:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Some Alterna Bank accounts can be accessed through branches, unlike most other direct banks.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
