<div id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We employ LM-eval-harness </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[</span><a href="#bib.bibx22" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">]</span></cite><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, LightEval </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[</span><a href="#bib.bibx26" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">]</span></cite><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, and EvalPlus </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[</span><a href="#bib.bibx36" title="" class="ltx_ref">36</a><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">]</span></cite><span id="A2.SS3.SSS3.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> with default settings for prompt templates, metrics, and decoding parameters. MMLU-Pro and GSM8K use few-shot evaluation (5 and 8 shots respectively) following standard protocols, while other benchmarks use zero-shot evaluation.</span></p>
</div>
